- a live linkCheck says 'ok';
- the listed URL, the final URL and the email share one registrable domain under the vendored Public Suffix List (including its private section);
- the domain is not free-mail, an ISP, a directory, a shortener, .gov/.edu/.us locality, or a foreign ccTLD;
