sweeps.method:
For the 432 'never names this shop' listings, the 116 unrelated-domain listings and the 225 trade-domain listings that don't name the shop, fetch the homepage and the contact page. Capture <title>, og:site_name, logo alt text, JSON-LD LocalBusiness name, address and telephone, all tel: hrefs and the footer text. These are fields the hours collect stage drops today.

PASS if any of: a distinctive name token in title, og, JSON-LD or logo alt; our phone digits anywhere; our street number plus street word plus our town or ZIP.

HOST-VENUE PASS if the page mentions cigar or lounge and shows our address or phone (casino, hotel, restaurant, tavern).

FAIL if any of:
- the site's own LocalBusiness markup names a different business at a different address;
- it is a cigar brand or manufacturer site (perdomocigars.com, habanos.com, illusionecigars.com, zigzag.com) that doesn't list this address;
- it is a known non-shop class (.gov, law, dental or medical, lyrics, blog platform, speed test, insurance) with no tobacco word;
- it passes no identity signal at all.

